2.  **`<script>` Tag:** Contains the JavaScript code. Placed at the end of the `<body>` to ensure the HTML elements exist when the script tries to access them. `DOMContentLoaded` listener is used for robustness.
3.  **`document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() { ... });`:** Ensures the script only runs after the entire HTML document has been loaded and parsed.
4.  **`getElementById('addUserButton')` and `getElementById('user_name')`:** Get references to the button and the input field elements using their IDs.
5.  **`fixedUserKey`:** Stores the constant user key value.
