This `ContainerQueryLayout` provides a flexible way to create composables whose appearance and layout adapt based on the space they are given by their parent, effectively bringing a form of container queries to Jetpack Compose. Remember to adjust the breakpoints in `ContainerInfo` to match your specific design requirements.
